                log (
                    {
                        at 2026-09-10T21:51:02.267989Z
                        author "brendan@bbqsrc.net"
                        kind @note
                        text "Idiom H4 + M43 + panic 5/6. (1) tokenizer.rs:179: a failed tokenize prints to stdout and substitutes String::new() — the request returns 200 with an exercise containing no exercises; propagate with ?. Same printStackTrace-as-println at noun_sg.rs:355,415 (dies in hd-enhancers fold), cg_enhancer.rs:523, activity_configuration.rs:389 — tracing::error! or propagation. (2) M43: page_handler.rs:120 let _ = create_dir_all; upload.rs:232-236 set_read_only discards metadata and set_permissions results, silently defeating STORED_MODE = 0o400 — check both. (3) Panic 5: vislcg3.rs:67-73 a readingless CG cohort (two adjacent \"<\" header lines) aborts the whole request via ?; skip the cohort. (4) Panic 6: vislcg3.rs:315 filters !line.is_empty() but a whitespace-only line passes starts_with([' ','\\t']) with empty split_whitespace and bails — filter on trim().is_empty(). run_fst_cg rebuilds the stream line-by-line so one stray \" \\n\" from the bundle is currently fatal. (5) M30: vislcg3.rs:67-73 first_reading formats {:?} of the reading and :193 substring-tests for \"CLB\" — a lemma containing CLB matches; use iter().any(|t| t == \"CLB\")."
                    }
