                        text "The mechanical sweep, scoped to what survives hd-mode/hd-enhancers/hd-error-paths. Full catalog in the idiomaticness review (session 903ca870, agent a6ff7a1af07a44192 output). Headlines: H5 i64 -1 sentinels -> Option<usize> (tokenizer.rs:37,73, sentences.rs:217, deletes the :230 guard and every cast); H6 per-sentence re-sort -> sort once + partition_point (sentences.rs:211); M2 thirteen new()+initialize() UIMA lifecycles -> fallible new(tags) (callers in flow.rs:69-119 already pair them); M7/M34 five encodings of annotation index order + two Spanned traits -> one trait+helper in types.rs; M8 contains_key-then-index chains -> get()?/entry() (activity_configuration.rs:453,493,543, processors.rs:385); M29 x = x + y string concat in loops, eight sites -> push_str; M40 CgReading = Vec<String> -> struct{lemma,tags} (kills three re-derivations); M35 infallible Result on render_page/render_spans; M37 handled in hd-cache; M44+coherence-LOW dead-code deletion: ExtCommandConsume2Logger/2String, TOKENIZERS/DETECTORS registries, /tmp/konteakstaInput.txt + /opt/smi shell strings, CHUNK_*_SUFFIX x6, cas_utils cancellation machinery (is_valid always true), activity_configuration client_config accessors + pub fn main (args[0] panic), object.rs/adverbial.rs dead get_lemma with #[should_panic] pins, unread AnalysisEngine fields, unread Token.detailedtag/.chunk/.mltag, html_enhancer::topic_title, M13 lib main. Plus panic 11: cg_enhancer.rs:317,332 current[1..] on a reading emptied by retain — move the is_empty check after retain (vislcg3.rs:329-333)."
